{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38709","headline":"奉试麦垄多秀色 · 汪极","name":"奉试麦垄多秀色","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南陌生岐穗，农家乐事多。\n塍畦交茂绿，苗实际清和。\n日布玲珑影，风翻浩荡波。\n来牟知帝力，含哺有衢歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"汪极","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38709.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38709","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}